{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-02-21 09:00:00', 'title': "ABBOTT'S CARDIOMEMS™ HF SYSTEM RECEIVES FDA APPROVAL TO SUPPORT PATIENTS BATTLING EARLIER-STAGE HEART FAILURE", 'text': "ABBOTT PARK, ILL., FEB. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS APPROVED AN EXPANDED INDICATION FOR THE COMPANY'S CARDIOMEMS™ HF SYSTEM TO SUPPORT THE CARE OF MORE PEOPLE LIVING WITH HEART FAILURE."}{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2022-02-22 16:05:00', 'title': 'AGILENT REPORTS FIRST-QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $A #AGILENT--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY REPORTED REVENUE OF $1.67 BILLION FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED JAN. 31, 2022, AN INCREASE OF 8% COMPARED TO THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021 AND UP 9% ON A CORE(1) BASIS. ON A GAAP BASIS, FIRST-QUARTER NET INCOME WAS $283 MILLION, OR $0.93 PER SHARE. THIS COMPARES WITH $288 MILLION, OR $0.93 PER SHARE, IN THE FIRST QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2021. NON-GAAP(2) NET INCOME WAS $368 MILLION, OR $1.21 PER SHARE DURING THE QUARTER, C'}{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-02-22 15:00:00', 'title': "TONIT CALAWAY ELECTED TO AIR PRODUCTS' BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., FEB. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TONIT CALAWAY HAS BEEN ELECTED TO AIR PRODUCTS' (NYSE:APD) BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 2022."}{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-02-22 10:00:00', 'title': "AIR PRODUCTS AGAIN EARNS SPOT ON BARRON'S 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE COMPANIES LIST", 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., FEB. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD), A LEADING GLOBAL INDUSTRIAL GASES COMPANY, HAS ONCE AGAIN EARNED A SPOT ON BARRON'S 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE COMPANIES LIST FOR THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR."}{'symbol': 'ARE', 'date': '2022-02-22 08:30:00', 'title': 'ALEXANDRIA REAL ESTATE EQUITIES, INC. ANNOUNCES LONG-TERM 334,000 RSF, FULL-BUILDING LEASE FOR THE NEW LILLY INSTITUTE FOR GENETIC MEDICINE AT 15 NECCO STREET IN THE SEAPORT INN